    "sensesNotes": "Darkvision 30 ft, Heat Sense",
    "tactics": "Striders carry desert nomads between distant water sources and can fight while encircled. They use their speed to break through a line rather than stand and trade ### Attacks.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Bite [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 7 + Melee Combat 3), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 10 damage (6 + 4 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 10 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Rear Kick [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 7 + Melee Combat 3), Reach: 5 ft; only against a creature behind the Strider</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 12 damage (8 + 4 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 12 damage, DR halved (round up); target is pushed 5 ft</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Heat Endurance: The Strider ignores ordinary penalties from extreme heat and can travel for a day on half the water required by a horse. Long Stride: Difficult terrain made of sand costs the Strider only 1.5 times its movement instead of double movement. Sure-Footed: The Strider has Fortune on Athletics checks made to cross dunes, scree, or narrow desert ledges.</p>",
